{"4850830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dodgeball Rush", "steam_appid": 4850830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodgeball Rush is a fast-paced third-person arcade sports game where timing, movement, and precision decide every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a ball, line up your target, charge powerful throws around defenders, and catch incoming attacks to turn the tables. Knock out every opponent before they do the same to your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo with AI teammates or bring friends into local co-op. Jump into a quick match, compete in an eight-team elimination tournament, or lead your chosen team through the campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast, accessible third-person dodgeball action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Single-player and local co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Charged throws, signature shots, catches, and quick dodges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Quick Play, Tournament, and Campaign modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Match formats ranging from 1v1 to 6v6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Distinct teams, arenas, and AI opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Create your own players and teams</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodgeball Rush is a fast-paced third-person arcade sports game where timing, movement, and precision decide every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a ball, line up your target, charge powerful throws around defenders, and catch incoming attacks to turn the tables. Knock out every opponent before they do the same to your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo with AI teammates or bring friends into local co-op. Jump into a quick match, compete in an eight-team elimination tournament, or lead your chosen team through the campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast, accessible third-person dodgeball action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Single-player and local co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Charged throws, signature shots, catches, and quick dodges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Quick Play, Tournament, and Campaign modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Match formats ranging from 1v1 to 6v6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Distinct teams, arenas, and AI opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Create your own players and teams</p>", "short_description": "Dodge, catch, and strike back in a fast-paced third-person arcade sports game. Challenge AI teams solo or bring friends into local co-op, master powerful charged and curved throws, and compete in quick matches, tournaments, and a campaign.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4850830/471cd6be907d875eff72af4f5eec435d34002601/header.jpg?t=1787127536", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4850830/d265455518e7854bd6a631ca5d0059adb4e4b94e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787127536", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4850830/d265455518e7854bd6a631ca5d0059adb4e4b94e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787127536", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit, version 21H1 or higher)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i3 or AMD FX equivalent (64-bit processor required)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / AMD HD 7850 (Must support DirectX 12 or Vulkan 1.3)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</st